# Google Maps Platform API Key
# Never commit your real API key or .env file to version control.
#
# Quickstart (Free Prototyping - No Billing Required):
#   1. Visit https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   2. Sign in with any Google account and accept the Maps Demo Project Terms.
#   3. Click to generate/reveal your Maps Demo Key (supports Maps JS, Places New, Routes, Geocoding).
#   4. Copy this file to .env and paste your key below.
#
# Production Setup:
#   - Create a key in Google Cloud Console: https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   - Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, Geocoding API.
#   - Restrict the key by HTTP referrer / server IP and specific APIs.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
